{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/surfitusa/items/688791/", "pk": 688791, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/surfitusa/", "pk": 4163, "shortname": "surfitusa", "name": "SURFit USA", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Florida Springs & Manatee Kayak or Paddleboard Adventure", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Florida Springs & Manatee Kayak or Paddleboard Adventure", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 21000, "description": "", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "Thank you for booking your spot on the Crystal River Springs & Manatee Experience! We’re excited to share this adventure with you. Please review the important details below:\n\n##Meeting Point:\nTampa International Airport (TPA) or the Crystal River Plantation Resort\nIf meeting at TPA, please arrive by 1:00 pm\nIf meeting at the hotel, check-in is available after 2:00 PM.\n\n##Accommodation:\nAll guests will have thier own room and bathroom at the newly renovated Crystal River Plantation Resort. \n\n##What to Bring:\nComfortable clothes for paddling and relaxing\nSwimsuit, towel, water shoes or sandals\nSun protection (hat, sunglasses, reef-safe sunscreen)\nReusable water bottle\nPersonal toiletries and medications\nRain jacket or light layers (weather can vary)\nCamera or phone for photos\nSmall daypack\nAny favorite snacks\n\n##What’s Included:\nAll paddling equipment, safety gear, meals, and guided activities\nAirport transfers (if meeting at TPA)\nAccommodation (3 nights)\nWelcome Social\nTransportation to All Paddle Locations\nBreakfast, Lunch and Most Dinners\n\n##What’s Not Included:\nAirfare to/from Tampa\nAlcoholic beverages\nTravel insurance\nGuide gratuities\nPersonal expenses\n\n##Payment Reminder:\nFull payment is due by January 12, 2026. You’ll receive a reminder as the date approaches.\nCancellation Policy:\nCancel before Jan 12: Refund minus $50 fee.\nAfter Jan 12: No refunds, but you can transfer your spot to another SURFit activity or future trip, subject to availability.\n\n##We’ll Be Reaching Out!\n\nTo make sure you have the best possible adventure, we’ll contact you via email soon to get to know you a little better. We’ll ask about:\nDietary preferences or food allergies\nPaddling experience and skill level\nRooming preferences (and if you’re traveling with someone)\nAny special requirements or questions\nOur goal is to make sure everyone is comfortable, well-prepared, and ready for an unforgettable time!\n\n##Final Details:\nA detailed trip itinerary and packing list will be sent 2 weeks before your departure.\nIf you have dietary restrictions or special needs, you can also let us know anytime at info@surfitusa.com.\n\n##Questions?\n\nContact us at 941-952-8245 or info@surfitusa.com. We’re here to help!", "cancellation_notes": "Payment & Cancellation Policy\nPayment:\nA $300 deposit per person is required to reserve your spot.\nFull payment is due by January 12, 2026.\nCancellation:\nCancellations before January 12, 2026: Deposit is refundable minus a $50 processing fee.\nCancellations after January 12, 2026: Payments a